{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57177","headline":"大乘赞十首 七 · 宝志","name":"大乘赞十首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"可笑衆生蠢蠢，各执一般异见。\n但欲傍鏊求饼，不岇返本观面。\n面是正邪之本，由人造作百变。\n所须任意纵横，不假偏耽爱恋。\n无着即是解脱，有求又遭罗罥。\n慈心一切平等，真如菩提自现。\n若怀彼我二心，对面不见佛面。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57177.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57177","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}